                                                                   325 1451
     The following revisions were made for MOD1 of ENDF/B-VI:      325 1451
                                                                   325 1451
 1. MF=1,MT=451 - Comments were added regarding estimated          325 1451
    (expanded) covariance for the Standards Cross Sections.        325 1451
